The unchanged tests/reference/vendor/mtp_varlen.hpp originates
from deepseek-ai/DeepInfer csrc/engine/mtp_varlen.hpp at commit
774ce244b87cc0eb8d4b94ab9f5de2ab22049f01 (Apache-2.0).
Its required sequence.hpp was not vendored. A separate minimal test-only host
boundary compiles the unchanged header as an independent C++ oracle. The
production src/deepinfer_mac/ds/ implementation follows this Apache-2.0 design
in portable Python. It is not linked to the C++ header. See upstream.lock.json.

MLX and MLX-LM are MIT-licensed runtime dependencies. The isolated greedy
speculative loop adaptation in src/deepinfer_mac/speculative.py is based on
MLX-LM 0.32.2. Its copyright and MIT notice are preserved in
third_party/licenses/MLX-LM.txt. Dependency and model licenses remain separate.

benchmarks/quality/vendor/ifeval_checkers.py contains seven unchanged checker
classes from Google Research's instruction_following_eval/instructions.py.
Copyright 2026 The Google Research Authors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
The local base interface and constants are adapters; exact source URL, SHA256,
class hashes and changes are recorded in benchmarks/quality/vendor/provenance.json.
This checker attribution does not grant rights to third-party benchmark prompts.

DSpark, DeepSeek V4.1 CED/CSA2/MTP, distributed KV storage, confidence heads,
and upstream CUDA/Ascend kernels have not been ported by this release.
